        "direction": "Natural, clear speech. Leave a short beat around the joke or emotional turn.",
        "context": "On Shipwreck Shore, preparing a boat to reach the remote Sunspire Palace."
      }
    },
    "sc.rose.angry": {
      "text": "Their names are still on that little board beside the wreck. Someone ought to straighten it before the tide takes it. I have nothing else to say to you.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "sorry",
          "text": "That was cruel. I am sorry.",
